#: b03408dbe299416abfc329466381c63b
msgid "剪切矩阵应变（Shear Matrix Strain）"
msgstr "Shear Matrix Strain"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:5
#: 26c69d9d1e9a4011aa0831756c9a9a01
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:7
#: 0a952afc2e4c49a8b7776e1069c4c12f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:9
#: 1fdd346debb8443b9f9a4216ac77c18f
msgid ""
"通过 xy/yz/xz 剪切矩阵分量生成非对角形变样本。对晶格矢量的三个剪切通道做系统"
"扫描，每个通道独立控制 min/max/step。"
msgstr ""
"Generate off-diagonal deformations by scanning xy, yz, and xz shear-matrix "
"components, each with an independent minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:11
#: 822ea0800d1545c794c05e94ac76093e
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:13
#: 3e4e1cd17ba84db6b125f2fc6db36391
msgid ""
"\\gamma_{xy}=\\frac{s_{xy}}{100},\\quad \\mathbf{S}=\\begin{bmatrix}"
"1&\\gamma_{xy}&\\gamma_{xz}\\\\0&1&\\gamma_{yz}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix},"
"\\quad \\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}\\mathbf{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:15
#: 5144a79a58644366aaee072202d25ac0
msgid "`symmetric=true` 时填充 S 的下三角对应项，使剪切路径更接近对称形变。"
msgstr ""
"With `symmetric=true`, matching lower-triangular entries are filled to form "
"a symmetric strain-like path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:17
#: f8bcebe2807f4e92b9ff707784b6809f
msgid ""
"其中 $s_{xy},s_{yz},s_{xz}$ 是界面输入的百分数，$\\gamma$ 是无量纲剪切量。 非"
"对称模式是简单剪切；对称模式同时填入转置位置。原子分数坐标保持不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:20
#: f2eda7d494bc491381bc2df0df6f8f01
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:22
#: eb20fed47f664d97b9a37ffd95ffde37
msgid "场景：模型预测剪切模量 C44 比 DFT 低 40%"
msgstr "Scenario: Predicted C44 is 40% below DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:24
#: 86fdad54864d4f3aaedb03d2d7df4300
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Al 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，C11/C12 都对，但 C44 只有 DFT 值的 60%。诊"
"断发现：C44 是对应于 xy/yz/xz 方向剪切的分量，而训练集里所有结构都是轴向拉伸/"
"压缩（通过 `Lattice Strain` 生成的），模型没见过非对角剪切变形。"
msgstr ""
"An fcc Al NEP reproduces C11 and C12 but predicts only 60% of the DFT C44. "
"Its training set contains axial strains but no off-diagonal shear states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:26
#: 59ae20860d824e5e9fb8c8ea48121e88
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 剪切弹性常数来源于非对角应变。如果训练集只覆盖对角应变（axial "
"strain），模型对剪切方向的刚度完全靠外推。需要往训练集里加入已知剪切分量的结"
"构。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Shear elastic constants derive from off-diagonal strain "
"response. Add cells with controlled shear components so that response is "
"interpolated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:28
#: 8bef0acf6e624234a7248a9edc61f6d6
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 fcc Al 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed fcc Al cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:30
#: 2821517332ed4652b2f4cb3c8d851fe7
msgid "**目标：** 沿 xy 方向做 -3% 到 +3% 剪切，步长 1%，对称模式，共 7 个结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Scan symmetric xy shear from -3% to +3% in 1% steps."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:32
#: 05c9b2ac27a84465acb75cdaeaeebcfd
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:33
#: 82a015bf2699427885260e09d00345e4
msgid "`XY 剪切范围`（`xy_range`） = `[-3, 3, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:34
#: 945738140e9c49a689cc245519e09301
msgid ""
"`YZ 剪切范围`（`yz_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 yz）—— 注意要把步长非零的值"
"写进去，否则 range 为空不生成"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:35
#: 19625dff54764a96988f57b177f91290
msgid "`XZ 剪切范围`（`xz_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 xz）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:36
#: aec40b38f4c04970bb65430c7de790b3
msgid "`对称剪切`（`symmetric`） = `true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:38
#: 85ca563370254c0595cfbe88702267cb
msgid ""
"**输出：** 7 个结构，剪切矩阵的 xy 分量从 -0.03 到 +0.03，yz 和 xz 分量为 0"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Seven structures with xy from -0.03 to +0.03 and zero yz/xz "
"components."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:40
#: ed97fac246aa4c04a67ba0c78aa151c6
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:41
#: d4b95868059642468851bf4a9c60e2c1
msgid "重训后重新计算弹性常数矩阵，C44 应该更接近 DFT 参考值"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, recompute the elastic tensor; C44 should "
"approach the DFT reference."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:42
#: b1f1fe9a60d341e591741a8eb0637ae9
msgid ""
"检查输出结构的晶格角变化：单斜/triclinic 体系剪切后角度会偏离正交，确认变化在"
"物理合理范围"
msgstr ""
"Inspect resulting cell angles and confirm that nonorthogonality remains in "
"the intended range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:43
#: ddb0133a2f23428c991f6ae2812d5cfe
msgid "如果 C44 改善但 C55/C66 仍有偏差，再单独扫 yz_range 和 xz_range"
msgstr "If C44 improves but C55/C66 do not, scan yz and xz separately."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:44
#: 40455f5f39bd413a9a91b70bc1655701
msgid ""
"如果三个分量都需要同时补，再同时放开三个 range —— 但注意输出数 = Nxy * Nyz * "
"Nxz，组合数很快爆炸"
msgstr ""
"Open all three ranges only when joint coverage is needed; output is Nxy × "
"Nyz × Nxz."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:46
#: c67cc643dec74fd89f6a99e6d994f10d
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:48
#: a14fab4faaab48bbb4c2958461cec7f5
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:49
#: 28a879edf7d245e3b489e8a422ab3f6a
msgid "模型剪切模量、非对角弹性常数系统性偏差"
msgstr "Shear modulus or off-diagonal elastic response is systematically wrong"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:50
#: c7550c39f7c846eaa8e2c10afdd9c15e
msgid "训练集缺少非正交晶格构型、所有结构都在高对称格点"
msgstr "Training lacks nonorthogonal cells"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:51
#: a33e7c1cc82641269e7bb7b28581d0da
msgid "需要覆盖剪切方向的应力-应变响应"
msgstr "Stress-strain response along shear directions is needed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:53
#: f623fdec088d4cf5bcfafbcf1192ca16
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:54
#: d69441957d5e4d5faa32e6ced1b51610
msgid "只需要体积和单轴应变 → `Lattice Strain` 更直接"
msgstr "Only volume and axial strain are needed; use `Lattice Strain`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:55
#: d5cbf70d2e594a2295144fe121987e0d
msgid "想通过角度而非矩阵分量控制剪切 → `Shear Angle Strain` 更适合"
msgstr ""
"Shear should be controlled through crystallographic angles; use `Shear Angle "
"Strain`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:56
#: 27c9d32305384be8bbaf840004819a00
msgid ""
"体系本身是刚性分子晶体，剪切只会破坏分子内拓扑 → 考虑 `识别有机分子`"
"（`identify_organic`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:58
#: d9949568dd2e45a08a1e26f2a4a98343
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:60
#: 518ec8cee6fd4e44bea348aa8e490103
msgid "XY 剪切范围（xy_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:62
#: 401d1a2c27ee4624b13ec40172883aeb
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。剪切矩阵 xy 分量的扫描"
"区间，格式 `[min, max, step]`，单位 %。比如 `sxy=5` 对应剪切矩阵分量 0.05。如"
"果你只扫一个分量，把另外两个设为一个点就行——但注意不能设成 `[0, 0, 0]`（步长"
"为 0 会让 range 变空），正确写法是 `[0, 0, 1]` 保证至少生成一个 0 点。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. xy scan as "
"`[min,max,step]` in percent; `5` means matrix component 0.05. Use `[0,0,1]` "
"for an inactive channel."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:64
#: dd92af04692f4369b30e1525c5077b17
msgid "YZ 剪切范围（yz_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:66
#: 7c72ac6cd9d14352b2e2519ea112830e
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。yz 分量的扫描区间，单"
"位和语法同 xy_range。同理，不扫时写 `[0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float,float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. yz scan with the same "
"syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:68
#: 92bb29fd93824c268d1deb0e1e27cbe2
msgid "XZ 剪切范围（xz_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:70
#: ef8c2c212766433594f788f37323d909
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。xz 分量的扫描区间，同"
"上。不扫时写 `[0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float,float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. xz scan with the same "
"syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:72
#: 3d556e8e95424cfdb9fc12298b940bbe
msgid ""
"输出总数 = Nxy * Nyz * Nxz。三个通道同时按默认值跑 = 11^3 = 1331 个结构。建议"
"先单通道试跑验证参数，再逐步加通道。"
msgstr ""
"Output is Nxy × Nyz × Nxz. Three default 11-point channels produce 1,331 "
"structures. Validate one channel first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:74
#: 47a0bf8dea3a4da5bc7c52a7df94d257
msgid "对称剪切（symmetric）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:76
#: 7fe34b62bae142fda23ef8ef053611cc
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后剪切矩阵下三角同步填充（比如 `S[1,0] = S[0,1]`），"
"形变路径更接近物理上的对称剪切。如果你在研究非对称畸变（比如某些铁弹相变），"
"把这个关掉。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Mirror upper-triangular components into the lower "
"triangle, for example `S[1,0]=S[0,1]`. Disable only for an intentionally "
"asymmetric deformation path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:78
#: fbee4bcb670748798905001d873c099d
msgid "识别有机分子（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:80
#: 29e8410a965648e0b37c2ad2a2ec6d24
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。分子晶体必须打开——否则剪切变形会撕裂分子内键。纯无机体"
"系关着即可。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable molecular protection for molecular crystals; "
"leave disabled for purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:82
#: b8c9e067b45e493389b95776d4c5601a
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

