msgstr ""
"Two-component shear coverage (xy and yz, ±5%, symmetric, about 121 outputs)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:98
#: 433dd92833dc4cc88b629487db99c01b
