msgstr "Three-channel study (±6%, step 2%, asymmetric, about 343 outputs)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:111
