#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:123
#: d2a09bee05b54748935a41a12dbfdd38
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:125
#: b1992b92891a4ad686ff2e942101c58b
msgid ""
"`Lattice Strain` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先补轴向应变，再补剪切分量，覆盖完"
"整弹性张量"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: cover axial response before shear "
"tensor components"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:126
#: 035788bf950d477691cf214b60853f46
msgid "`Shear Matrix Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：剪切变形后加坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Shear Matrix Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate noise after a "
"shear deformation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:127
#: 5d83ef8183ee454996bff4c339936f68
msgid ""
"`Super Cell` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先扩胞再剪切，适合研究大尺度剪切响应"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: shear at the intended cell scale"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:129
#: 51594d995b3f4ab5a417d9d548bdcda9
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:131
#: 4d04ce10c52b4140ad805776cfc1f05e
msgid ""
"**输出为空。** 检查 range 的步长是否 > 0。如果不扫某个分量，不能设置 `[0, 0, "
"0]` —— 步长为 0 会导致 range 为空。应该设置 `[0, 0, 1]` 确保至少生成一个点"
"（0）。"
msgstr ""
"**No output.** Every step must be positive; use `[0,0,1]` for an inactive "
"component."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:133
#: c8a16f2dda9d43ce9a80db0328f343f6
msgid ""
"**输出数量爆炸。** 三通道联扫的输出数 = Nxy * Nyz * Nxz。默认 `[-5, 5, 1]` 三"
"个通道同时开 = 11^3 = 1331 个结构。建议先单通道试跑验证参数合理性后再加通道。"
msgstr ""
"**Output explodes.** Three channels form a Cartesian product. Validate one "
"channel and estimate the total before adding more."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:135
#: 93cf95e5e25545e89f6d5e988e38d095
msgid ""
"**剪切后结构物理不合理。** 剪切幅度过大导致晶格条件数恶化（接近奇异）。抽查最"
"近邻距离和晶格行列式。±5% 以上建议逐步增加并每步检查。"
msgstr ""
"**Geometry becomes implausible.** Excessive shear can make the lattice ill-"
"conditioned. Inspect nearest-neighbor distances and the cell determinant, "
"increasing beyond ±5% gradually."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:137
#: ebaec0354cde447c80880f716084424a
msgid ""
"**vs Shear Angle Strain 如何选择。** Shear Matrix 在笛卡尔坐标下直接修改剪切"
"矩阵分量，适合和弹性常数计算对齐；Shear Angle 修改晶胞角度 alpha/beta/gamma，"
"适合和 XRD/晶体学角度对齐。两者产生不同的形变路径，可以互补使用。"
msgstr ""
"**Matrix or angle shear?** Matrix shear directly controls Cartesian off-"
"diagonal components and aligns with elastic-tensor calculations. Angle shear "
"controls alpha, beta, and gamma and aligns with crystallographic "
"descriptions. They are distinct paths and may be complementary."

